sequenceDiagram
accTitle: One flow crosses the same stateful appliance in both directions
accDescr: A Gateway Load Balancer endpoint sends both the outbound and return packet through GWLB and the same firewall. This complete zonal path is deployed in a second AZ for availability.
participant T as TGW
participant E as Zonal GWLBE
participant G as GWLB + firewall
participant N as Zonal NAT / internet
Note over T,N: Complete zonal path also deployed in AZ B
T->>E: Outbound packet
E->>G: Inspect through selected firewall
G->>E: Return inspected packet
E->>N: Continue outbound route
N->>E: Return packet
E->>G: Same flow, same firewall
G->>E: Return inspected packet
E->>T: Route back to spoke
Note over T,G: TGW appliance mode and symmetric routes preserve flow affinity
